$NetBSD$

Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), LGPL-2.1-or-later.
Link colorstate to its existing texture helper on every platform. The helper
already reports unsupported DMA-BUF operations when unavailable; having DRM
fourcc headers alone does not imply a Linux DMA-BUF implementation.

--- testsuite/gdk/meson.build.orig
+++ testsuite/gdk/meson.build
@@ -46,7 +46,9 @@
   ]
 else
   tests += [
-    { 'name': 'colorstate' }
+    { 'name': 'colorstate',
+      'sources': [ 'udmabuf.c' ],
+    }
   ]
 endif
 
